Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Freelancers live in chat, but invoicing still means dashboards and forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What if billing were just a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,ENSIDEX Invoice Agent is an AI chat agent built on the PayPal developer platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In this recording, the AI runs live on OpenRouter, and PayPal runs in the app's built-in mock mode, exactly as the header shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The agent picks the client, the amount and the purpose, turns "Friday" into a real date, and calls its create-invoice tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,With sandbox credentials set, that tool creates and sends a PayPal invoice through the Invoicing API.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It works in Arabic too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Riyals, Thursday, and the reply comes back in Arabic, right to left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.26,0:00:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thursday becomes November fifth, and the currency is set to Saudi riyals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a one-off payment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The payment-link tool uses the PayPal Orders API to return a checkout link, right in the same chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask for a summary, and the AI reads your invoices, lists what's outstanding, and flags what's overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Omar's invoice from October is flagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.83,0:01:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,One more message, and the agent calls its reminder tool for that invoice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the hood: Hono on Node 22, React 19, OpenRouter tool calling, PayPal Invoicing v2 and Orders v2.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.90,0:01:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,An offline parser and a mock PayPal mean anyone can run it, and the test suite passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.12,0:01:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Open source under MIT, and one Docker command to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,ENSIDEX Invoice Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Say who owes you, and get paid.
